        }
      },
      "system": {
        "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The yao guai is quick to action when it senses prey. When the&nbsp;</span>yao guai enters a scene, immediately generate 1 Action Point. If the yao guai&nbsp;is an ally, then this goes into the group pool. If it is an enemy, it goes into the GM&rsquo;s pool.</p>",
