    "biography": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">These terrifying creatures are what remains of the bear population after the Great War. Heavily mutated, with longer claws, more muscle mass, and a powerful bite, the yao guai is not a creature any wasteland traveler wants to come across. They are territorial and protective of their young and pack if part of one. These violent creatures have even been known to take on deathclaws if they threaten the yao guai&rsquo;s territory.</span></p>",
